# Documentation Architecture for MOT Firmware Learning

Plan for creating a structured knowledge base inside `MOT/Docs/` to learn firmware repositories one by one, starting from `main()` / `setup()→loop()`.

---

## Proposed Folder Structure

```
MOT/Docs/
├── README.md                          ← Learning roadmap & index
├── Chats/                             ← (existing) exported chat logs
│
├── Architecture/
│   └── MOT_System_Architecture.md     ← Full project overview, wiring, converters
│
├── Firmware/                          ← One sub-folder per firmware repo
│   ├── MOT-ELVH-STM8/
│   │   ├── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md          ← Code walkthrough from main()
│   │   └── REAL_TIME_EXAMPLES.md      ← Register/memory-level execution traces
│   ├── MOT-SHT40-STM8/
│   │   ├── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│   │   └── REAL_TIME_EXAMPLES.md
│   ├── MOT-CONTROLLER-CARD/
│   │   ├── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│   │   └── REAL_TIME_EXAMPLES.md
│   ├── MOT-STM32-BOOTLOADER/         ← Learning/testing only, not in production
│   │   ├── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│   │   └── REAL_TIME_EXAMPLES.md
│   ├── MOT-SURGEON-DISP/
│   │   ├── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│   │   └── REAL_TIME_EXAMPLES.md
│   ├── MOT-RGB-SLAVE/
│   │   ├── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│   │   └── REAL_TIME_EXAMPLES.md
│   ├── MOT-RGB-TCP/
│   │   ├── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│   │   └── REAL_TIME_EXAMPLES.md
│   ├── MOT-RGB-DMX/
│   │   ├── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│   │   └── REAL_TIME_EXAMPLES.md
│   └── XRAY-VIEWER-STM8/
│       ├── FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md
│       └── REAL_TIME_EXAMPLES.md
│
├── Controllers/                       ← One doc per MCU family
