## Learning Order

| # | Firmware | MCU | Controller Doc First? | Protocols Touched | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | **MOT-ELVH-STM8** | STM8S003F3P | Yes → `Controllers/STM8.md` | I2C, PWM, UART | Start here — simplest firmware |
| 2 | **MOT-SHT40-STM8** | STM8S003F3P | No (already done) | I2C, PWM, UART | Similar to #1 |
| 3 | **MOT-CONTROLLER-CARD** | STM32F407VGTx | Yes → `Controllers/STM32.md` | UART, ADC, PWM | FreeRTOS, multi-task |
| 4 | **MOT-SURGEON-DISP** | STM32 | No | UART, RS-485 | Display + serial |
| 5 | **MOT-RGB-SLAVE** | ESP32 | Yes → `Controllers/ESP32.md` | Modbus, RS-485 | Arduino/ESP-IDF |
| 6 | **MOT-RGB-TCP** | ESP32 | No | TCP, WiFi | Same MCU, different protocol |
| 7 | **MOT-RGB-DMX** | ESP32 | No | DMX | Same MCU, different protocol |
| 8 | **XRAY-VIEWER-STM8** | STM8 | No | GPIO, Relay | Simple I/O |
| 9 | **MOT-STM32-BOOTLOADER** | STM32F407VGTx | No | UART, OTA Protocol | *Learning/testing only — not currently in production* |

