## Document Style Guidelines

Based on user preferences derived from existing docs:

| Style | Used For | Example Source |
|---|---|---|
| Flash memory layout tables | Memory maps, sector assignments | [MOT-STM32-BOOTLOADER/README.md](file:///c:/Users/oml/Documents/BitBucket/MOT/MOT-STM32-BOOTLOADER/README.md) |
| Byte-level conversation traces | Protocol exchanges on the wire | Bootloader README "Conversation Example" |
| Mermaid diagrams | Architecture, flow diagrams, decision trees | `walkthrough.md` |
| Step-by-step event tables | Showing time → event → internal state | CommandThrottle walkthrough |
| Register bit diagrams (ASCII) | BEFORE/AFTER register state | [REAL_TIME_EXAMPLES_STEP_BY_STEP.md](file:///c:/Users/oml/Documents/GitHub/MOT/MOT-ELVH-STM8/GUIDENS/REAL_TIME_EXAMPLES_STEP_BY_STEP.md) |
| Physical pin waveforms (ASCII) | I2C/UART signal timing | [REAL_TIME_EXAMPLES_STEP_BY_STEP.md](file:///c:/Users/oml/Documents/GitHub/MOT/MOT-ELVH-STM8/GUIDENS/REAL_TIME_EXAMPLES_STEP_BY_STEP.md) |
| Code with inline annotations | Actual firmware code walkthrough | Chat history STM8 guide |

### Document Naming Convention

| Type | Pattern | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Firmware guide | `Firmware/<REPO>/FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md` | `Firmware/MOT-ELVH-STM8/FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md` |
| Real-time examples | `Firmware/<REPO>/REAL_TIME_EXAMPLES.md` | `Firmware/MOT-ELVH-STM8/REAL_TIME_EXAMPLES.md` |
| Controller ref | `Controllers/<MCU>.md` | `Controllers/STM8.md` |
| Protocol ref | `Protocols/<PROTOCOL>.md` | `Protocols/I2C.md` |
| Fundamentals | `Fundamentals/<TOPIC>.md` | `Fundamentals/PWM.md` |
| Comm basics | `Fundamentals/Serial_Communication_Basics.md` | — |
| Architecture | `Architecture/MOT_System_Architecture.md` | — |

