## Proposed Changes Summary

### New files

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `Docs/README.md` | Master index and learning roadmap |
| `Architecture/MOT_System_Architecture.md` | System diagram, wiring table, converter details |
| `Firmware/<REPO>/FIRMWARE_GUIDE.md` (×9) | Placeholder per firmware |
| `Firmware/<REPO>/REAL_TIME_EXAMPLES.md` (×9) | Placeholder per firmware |
| `Controllers/STM8.md`, `STM32.md`, `ESP32.md` | Controller references (created before learning that MCU) |
| `Protocols/*.md` (×7) | Protocol references (created on demand) |
| `Fundamentals/Serial_Communication_Basics.md` | Frame formats (8N1, parity, etc.) |
| `Fundamentals/*.md` (×6 more) | PWM, ADC, Polling/Interrupt/DMA, etc. (created on demand) |

### No changes to firmware repositories
All documentation lives exclusively in `MOT/Docs/`.

